<section class="hero"><div class="shell">
  <div class="eyebrow">Gwap Gang // Search Intelligence V0.1</div>
  <h1>Find The Demand<br>You Are Missing.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Search Intelligence shows where people are already looking, where your site is failing to meet that demand, and what to fix first. The goal is not more SEO activity. The goal is a clearer path from search behavior to qualified attention and commercial opportunity.</p>
  <div class="hero-meta"><span>Visibility</span><span>Demand</span><span>Indexing</span><span>Content Gaps</span><span>Priority</span></div>
